<SCENARIO VER="105">
{PLAYSND "in_dream低.ogg" "BGM" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "3000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋赤.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{CREATECG "アイテム1" "グラフィック\立ち絵\アイテム\スマフォ黄入.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "650" "C" "100" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
<TXSPN>As lightly as that, <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> said something enormous.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
But, when it is confessed as head-on as this, the factors that deny it come into my head one after another.<PG>
I know. <STYLE ID="1">Senpai</STYLE> has not killed anyone.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
At the very least a car is needed, and the body has to be moved.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
To begin with, flaying someone alive must take considerable skill.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
A crime on that scale is not something a high-school girl could do.
{CREATECG "リファレンス解禁画像" "グラフィック\システム\リファレンス解禁画像.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "84" "600" "0" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
<PG>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, calm down. It is going to be all right.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">“I'm going to turn myself in.”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">“Wait! It's a misunderstanding! </STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">!”</STYLE>
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="3">“But probably, </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Natsumi</STYLE><STYLE ID="3"> can't be saved any more.”</STYLE><PG>
The conversation had fallen apart completely.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
{PLAYSND "SE\携帯押す.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
<STYLE ID="2">“</STYLE><STYLE ID="3">Senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2">, it hurts, doesn't it? It's painful, isn't it? Talk to me. I'll hear all of it. I'm on your side. </STYLE><STYLE ID="4">Kogori-senpai</STYLE><STYLE ID="2"> is on your side too.”</STYLE><PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{STOPSND "BGM" "5000" "PASS"}
{CHANGECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島の部屋.gal" "NORMAL" "1" "3000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
―After that, no more replies came.
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
Surely she had not really gone to turn herself in?
{PAUSE ""}
<BR>
<STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE>, do not do anything rash...! <STYLE ID="1">Niimura-senpai</STYLE> being the culprit is impossible by any logic!<PG>
{MESOFF "500"}
{DELETECG "アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "1"}
{PLAYSND "SE\室内ドア早い開閉.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{DELETECG "000,アイテム1" "1" "500" "0" "0" "" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{STOPSND "VOICE" "1000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{PLAYSND "SE\iron_door2_O.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{CREATECG "000" "グラフィック\背景\五島家夜.gal" "NORMAL" "#1" "C" "B" "0" "1" "1000" "0" "0" "" "0" "0" "0" "255" ""}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車開始.ogg" "VOICE" "NORMAL" "1000" "0"}
{WAITPLAY "VOICE" "CLICK"}
{PLAYSND "SE\自転車こぐ.ogg" "VOICE" "REPEAT" "1000" "0"}
{WAIT "1000" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{MESON "500"}
I hurried into my coat, ran out of the house and got onto my bicycle.
{STOPSND "VOICE" "3000" "PASS"}
{WAIT "100" "CLICK" "SKIP"}
{DELETECG "文字カウント画像" "1" "0" "0" "0" "" "0"}
<PG>
{}
<EVENT VALUE="MESEND">
